lso unfriendly. Candidate D unknown reliability and crew cooperation, also considered loner/moody.\n\nThus candidate C seems strongest overall, but we need to consider communication issues. However we have no evidence that those issues affect safety; but they are concerns. Still, compared to others, C seems best. So provisional vote for Candidate C.\n\nPublic message: Summarize evidence, note gaps, propose next focus maybe on technical competence and stress resilience for all, especially D and A. Also ask if anyone has observations on Candidate D's reliability and crew cooperation. Also ask about Candidate A's stress handling. But we have limited time; maybe ask for D's reliability and crew cooperation.\n\nThus public message: \"We have now reliability and crew cooperation evidence for B and C; C strong, B reliability but crew issue; A and D still missing. To compare, we need reliability/crew cooperation for D (and A). Also need technical competence and stress resilience for all. I propose we gather those. My provisional vote is Candidate C, pending further info.\"\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
